<title>NEW ZEALAND: Carter Holt Harvey to modernise Kinleith.</title>
<headline>Carter Holt Harvey to modernise Kinleith.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carter Holt Harvey Ltd (CHH) said on Tuesday that it would soon announce a major modernisation of its pulp and paper mill at Kinleith.</p>
<p>Details of the project would be announced at a briefing on December 5, CHH said in a statement.</p>
<p>CHH is just over half owned by International Paper.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
